   "source": [
    "### Compute radius statistics by year\n",
    "\n",
    "**Instruction:**\n",
    "- For each discovery year compute the **mean** **median** of planet radius (`pl_rade`) \n",
    "- Sort the results by year in ascending order.\n",
    "- Use pandas groupby and aggregations;\n",
    "- Show the first 10 years as a sample"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "2690ede3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "                mean     median\n",
      "disc_year                      \n",
      "1999       15.468420  15.468420\n",
      "2001       11.242627  11.242627\n",
      "2002       14.571700  14.571700\n",
      "2004        9.886131  12.117000\n",
      "2005       11.531903  12.532910\n",
      "2006       12.700952  13.518054\n",
      "2007       14.166143  14.751104\n",
      "2008       13.961444  13.849042\n",
      "2009       12.687245  13.332961\n",
      "2010       10.911765  12.111184\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#TODO: Compute mean and median of planet radius per discovery year\n",
    "#Show the first 10 years as a sample\n",
    "radius_stats = df.groupby(\"disc_year\")[\"pl_rade\"].agg([\"mean\", \"median\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "radius_stats = radius_stats.sort_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(radius_stats.head(10))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6c6b7d56",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Interactive visualization of radius statistics over time\n",
    "Create an interactive plot using hvplot to visualize how mean, median, and mode planet radius change over discovery years. This interactive visualization allows you to zoom, pan, and hover to see exact values.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Use hvplot.line() to create separate line plots for each statistic,then overlay them using the * operator. \n",
    "- Add appropriate labels, colors, and formatting options.\n",
    "- Be sure to add a title and label the axes."
   ]
  },
  {
